# The 1939 scenario as the Allied side, written by hand: the settings of UTILITY, each changed and most
# changed back; then END TURN every month to the end, the Hall of Fame, and Quit. Left out: Keyboard
# (it turns the mouse on), Begin PBM, and PBM Drv, whose menu shows the drive the game runs from.
#! seed 1939

# Waits that any key ends.
rule 1 key space

# The title menu: Start NEW Game. Start Year: 1939.
play until 2:W
text s
play until 2:S
key enter

# UTILITY. 1 Player: two players, and back.
play until 2:M
digest
text u
play until 2:U
digest
text 1
play until 2:U
digest
text 2
# Noise: the SOUNDS menu, Quiet.
play until 2:U
text n
play until 2:S
digest
text q
# Display: the Speed menu, Fast, then Normal again.
play until 2:U
text d
play until 2:S
digest
text f
play until 2:U
digest
text d
play until 2:S
text n
# Weather off and on, Autosave on and off.
play until 2:U
text w
play until 2:U
digest
text w
play until 2:U
text a
play until 2:U
digest
text a
# End Cond.
play until 2:U
text e
prompt
digest
key esc
# Hi Scores: the scores, and NO to clearing them.
play until 2:U
text h
play until 2:C
digest
text n
# Vary Start: the Start Year menu again (1939), then armies placed at random.
play until 2:U
text v
play until 2:S
digest
key enter
play until 2:U
digest
# Balance: the menu with the commanders' faces, Allied +, then Esc to the main menu.
text b
play until 2:B
digest
text a
play until 2:B
digest
key esc

# Side: now the Axis side; then back to the Allied side.
play until 2:M
digest
text u
play until 2:U
text s
play until 2:M
digest
text u
play until 2:U
text s

# END TURN every month to the end.
rule 2:M text e
rule 2:R key enter
rule 2:E text y
play until 4
text Tester
key enter
prompt
digest
key space
prompt
digest
key space

# Back at the title menu: Quit, and a key for END's "Press any key to continue".
play until 2:W
digest
text q
repeat space
